//   camH camera height (m, 3.2 by default: raise it when the car hides the road) · vit [start, full] range of the displayed speed effects in km/h (shake, vignette, blur, wide angle; default 130, 200), to be set on the map's true speeds · tun [a, b] tunnel between two points (or null) · chaud [a, b] sector where the music goes wild · amb [[a, b], …] zones where the place's ambience is heard · sect [a, b] the two intermediate sections
//   sauts [[point, length, height, pit, depth], …] ramp that ends cleanly at the point, followed or not by a pit (m) · cuv [[a, b, width, radius], …] rollable walls: a quarter tube on each side of the flat between points a and b. Either one activates the relief (height, gravity, flight: see sim.js); th.wallFace = texture of the rollable walls
