//   lookAhead: the autopilot computes its braking distance (essential as soon as there is a hairpin)
//   rivals: first names of the three rivals in race mode (otherwise those of the town) · med: medals [bronze, silver, gold] as multiples of the autopilot's flying lap (default 1.1 / 1.03 / 0.97; lower where skidding pays off a lot) · traffic: number of trucks to overtake · corde [a, b]: between these points, grazing the wall without touching it fills the nitro (NI.racingLine in sim.js) · car: the car (CARD format in sim.js) · radio: stations (see RADIO below) · th: theme
//   th.hud: the map's interface · y c r colours (text, accent, alert), panel background · panel style (cyber, line, panel, plate, block, board, rally, frost) · rev counter gauge (default equaliser, needle, led) · mph: speedometer in miles · jp: Japanese labels · sur, titre: subtitle and menu title
